        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001819790-26-000019-8fc3b37f2f4a5949",
        "accession_number": "0001819790-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "at the federal, state and local level and in other countries extensively regulate, among other things, the research, development, testing, manufacture, quality control, approval, labeling, packaging, storage, record-keeping, promotion, advertising, distribution, post-approval monitoring and reporting, marketing and export and import of drug products such as those we are developing.",
